# the Bar page, SEQ held: black keys 1-4 are the bars. One jumps (and un-loops), two held loop that range, one tapped
# twice loops that bar; stopped it is at once, playing at the next bar line
wait 300
expect trk 1
# (WARP-8: the kit's length is HOME's knob 2; Steps' knobs are the picked drum's)
tap HOME
turn K2 48
tap SEQ
wait 1200
turn SELECT 1
expect page Bar
expect loop 1 1 64
press SEQ
tapkey b3
expect loop 1 1 64
wait 500
tapkey b3
wait 60
tapkey b3
expect loop 1 49 64
key b1 down
wait 60
key b2 down
wait 60
key b1 up
key b2 up
expect loop 1 17 48
tapkey b3
wait 500
tapkey b3
wait 60
tapkey b3
expect loop 1 49 64
wait 300
shot loop_bar.png
release SEQ
tap PLAY
wait 40
expect step 1 48
press SEQ
tapkey b0
wait 300
shot loop_bar_pending.png
expect loop 1 49 64
wait 2600
expect loop 1 1 64
release SEQ
tap PLAY
